<resources>
    <!--
        Settings search: the words people type to find a setting, one string per setting
        (search_kw_<id>, the ids of ui/SettingsCatalog.kt).

        For translators: this is a list, not a sentence. Separate the entries with commas; an
        entry may be several words ("kill switch"). Write what a person would type in your
        language when looking for the setting: other names for it, abbreviations, slang, the
        problem it solves, typical values. Words of the setting's own title need not be
        repeated, the order does not matter, and more is better. English and Russian are always
        searched as well, whatever the language of the interface.
    -->

    <!-- The little words of a question, which a query is understood without: "how do I change the port" is "port". -->
